  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Brand introduction:</strong><br>Brunde is a brand of Brown fleece-lined tights designed to look natural while keeping you warm. This idea came to me because I always struggled to find fleece tights that suited me. Most of the options I found had a greyish undertone and didn&rsquo;t feel like they were made with skin tones like mine in mind. I was tired of waiting for major brands to create something inclusive, so I decided to take matters into my own hands and launch Brunde.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Product description:&nbsp;</strong><br>Our tights are fleece-lined on the inside to keep you warm, while the outside looks like classic brown translucent tights. They&rsquo;re perfect for cold weather and stylish enough for any outfit, giving you both comfort and elegance.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br>Unlike other brands, Brunde&rsquo;s shades are designed to be inclusive of a variety of skin tones, ensuring that many can find a match. Our mission is to create tights that celebrate diversity rather than exclude large parts of the population.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br><strong>&bull; Payment terms:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We pay commissions through PayPal twice a month, on the 1st and the 15th. You&rsquo;ll also have access to a dashboard where you can track your sales, commissions, and payouts in real time.</p>",
